// Evaluator-authored supplementary deterministic cases for the devforge-release scaffold review.
// Written by the independent evaluator, not by the candidate's author, because the candidate's own
// C-tier cases check six release-record fields and file presence and leave the derivation spot-checks,
// the docs/mvp runtime-dependency question and the shipped-template state unobserved.
// Run with the frozen validator runner/graders at commit e641797eebf04cd1e8eb9f711549e038e7745407.
// These are observations, never a verdict: MATCH / MISMATCH / INDETERMINATE only, and no aggregate.
{"case_id":"EVAL-C-101","tier":"C","title":"Every field the governing release-record template defines is populated in the worked-good fixture","prompt":"Check the complete template field set, not a selected subset, against the fixture the package offers as a correct result.","files":["fixtures/good/REL-008.md"],"candidate_subpath":"evals/fixtures/good","expectations":{"summary":"The candidate's own REL-C-004 checks six fields. This case checks every envelope scalar and every prose field the governing template docs/mvp/templates/devforge-release/release-record.md defines, so a field the author's case does not name cannot pass unobserved. Block-valued envelope keys (producer, upstream, evidence, missing_inputs) are excluded because the grader reads scalar values only."},"assertions":[{"assertion_id":"A1","grader":"required_report_fields","args":{"file":"REL-008.md","fields":["schema_version","artifact_id","artifact_type","project_id","revision","status","created_at_utc","execution_ref","supersedes","decision_ref","QA report","Candidate snapshot and mapped Git commit/tree","Story/epic references","Target repository/branch/environment","Integration worktree/session assignment","Final external verification","Title","Body","Release notes","Applicable migration and recovery steps","Deterministic CI result and exact revision","Model-driven Codex GitHub Action","Operational feedback / unresolved risk","Change-request references","Handoff reference"]},"expect":"complete"}]}
{"case_id":"EVAL-C-102","tier":"C","title":"Derivation destinations hash to what references/derivation.json records","prompt":"Independently verify the digests the package's own provenance record asserts for its copied and adapted files.","files":[],"expectations":{"summary":"Five spot-checks. assets/release-record.md must equal the governing template's bytes (90b8e58f...), the three other derivation destinations must equal their recorded destination_sha256, and evals/fixtures/stale/preserved/QA-014.r1.md must equal evals/fixtures/QA-014.md, which is what the stale-upstream case's 'point at the preserved copy' expectation depends on."},"assertions":[{"assertion_id":"A1","grader":"artifact_side_effect","args":{"sentinels":[{"path":"assets/release-record.md","sha256":"90b8e58f54eec19bb809a2aad5fb670b4616a32e3543815221818f66308e67eb"},{"path":"assets/handoff.md","sha256":"b2dbc7cc1083d423d8806e706d564b409edcc7d29f94108dbbfae455cad6b9dd"},{"path":"references/recording-rules.md","sha256":"43dcf6c27e61a3d5dea009606cb0354485ada2ea6a7633649ce9b12303429408"},{"path":"references/delivery-actions.md","sha256":"20f5e450c71fdf960ec9b344cd0056bc35a9b2f594d7a970c5f26b7f75f1ba70"},{"path":"evals/fixtures/stale/preserved/QA-014.r1.md","sha256":"1284c83cc305dae8807feaa310ec2a4eb35c798212ce9bd50d5a0d340110cd78"}]},"expect":"unchanged"}]}
{"case_id":"EVAL-C-103","tier":"C","title":"The runtime entrypoint carries no developer home path, no repository docs path and no shell-injection syntax","prompt":"Scan the entrypoint for strings that would make an installed copy depend on the authoring machine or the DevForgeAI repository.","files":[],"expectations":{"summary":"SKILL.md is the only file loaded on invocation. A '/home/' or '/Users/' path would bind it to an authoring machine; a 'docs/mvp' path would bind it to this repository's tree; '!`' is the Codex/slash-command shell-injection form and must not appear in a Claude skill body."},"assertions":[{"assertion_id":"A1","grader":"artifact_side_effect","args":{"scan_file":"SKILL.md","forbidden_strings":["/home/","/Users/","docs/mvp","!`","$ARGUMENTS","agents/openai.yaml"]},"expect":"absent"},{"assertion_id":"A2","grader":"artifact_side_effect","args":{"scan_file":"references/delivery-actions.md","forbidden_strings":["/home/","/Users/","docs/mvp","!`","$ARGUMENTS"]},"expect":"absent"},{"assertion_id":"A3","grader":"artifact_side_effect","args":{"scan_file":"references/recording-rules.md","forbidden_strings":["/home/","/Users/","!`","$ARGUMENTS"]},"expect":"absent"},{"assertion_id":"A4","grader":"artifact_side_effect","args":{"scan_file":"assets/handoff.md","forbidden_strings":["/home/","/Users/","docs/mvp","!`","$ARGUMENTS"]},"expect":"absent"}]}
{"case_id":"EVAL-C-104","tier":"C","title":"The shipped release-record asset is still a blank template","prompt":"Check that the asset the skill tells a session to fill has not been shipped already filled in.","files":[],"expectations":{"summary":"assets/release-record.md must still hold its placeholders. Expected observation: MISMATCH with observed 'placeholder'. A MATCH here would mean the shipped template had been populated with some session's content, which is the defect this case looks for; the MISMATCH is the correct result."},"assertions":[{"assertion_id":"A1","grader":"required_report_fields","args":{"file":"assets/release-record.md","fields":["artifact_id","created_at_utc","Title","Target repository/branch/environment","Handoff reference"]},"expect":"placeholder_detected_as_mismatch"}]}
{"case_id":"EVAL-C-105","tier":"C","title":"The package declares no executable, hook or provider-metadata surface","prompt":"Check for directories a Claude skill package of this kind should not carry.","files":[],"expectations":{"summary":"The package declares no scripts, and SKILL.md names none. hooks/ is integration-owner scope, not skill-author scope. agents/ is where Codex subagent metadata would sit. All three must be absent, and the authored trigger file must be present."},"assertions":[{"assertion_id":"A1","grader":"path_absent","args":{"path":"scripts"},"expect":"absent"},{"assertion_id":"A2","grader":"path_absent","args":{"path":"hooks"},"expect":"absent"},{"assertion_id":"A3","grader":"path_absent","args":{"path":"agents"},"expect":"absent"},{"assertion_id":"A4","grader":"path_present","args":{"path":"evals/triggers/trigger-queries.json"},"expect":"present"}]}
{"case_id":"EVAL-C-106","tier":"C","title":"Local links inside the eval inputs and the worked-good fixture resolve","prompt":"Check the local Markdown destinations of files the candidate's own link cases do not cover.","files":[],"expectations":{"summary":"The candidate's REL-C-003 covers sources.md, recording-rules.md, delivery-actions.md and assets/handoff.md. It does not cover the fixtures README or the worked-good record."},"assertions":[{"assertion_id":"A1","grader":"package_relative_links","args":{"file":"evals/fixtures/README.md"},"expect":"all_resolve"},{"assertion_id":"A2","grader":"package_relative_links","args":{"file":"evals/fixtures/good/REL-008.md"},"expect":"all_resolve"},{"assertion_id":"A3","grader":"package_relative_links","args":{"file":"assets/release-record.md"},"expect":"all_resolve"}]}
{"case_id":"EVAL-C-107","tier":"C","title":"The frontmatter carries name and description and nothing that grants a permission","prompt":"Check the entrypoint frontmatter for fields beyond the two the specification and the authoring contract allow.","files":[],"expectations":{"summary":"The specification and the skill-authoring contract permit frontmatter name and description only. An allowed-tools key would grant tool permission without asking; the package's own sources.md states it deliberately declares none. This scans the entrypoint for the key form."},"assertions":[{"assertion_id":"A1","grader":"frontmatter_fields","args":{"file":"SKILL.md","fields":["name","description"]},"expect":"populated"},{"assertion_id":"A2","grader":"artifact_side_effect","args":{"scan_file":"SKILL.md","forbidden_strings":["allowed-tools:","allowed_tools:","model:","license:"]},"expect":"absent"}]}
